    "claim": "On 023b7fcc, with the car 2 s early at 0.5x and the ego at 1.4x, every repeat failed. This is the classic lead-vehicle failure: the policy took over with a short gap to the slow car it was following, braked only lightly, planned a late swerve and hit car 12's rear. The ego was also rear-ended in these runs; that does not count as the policy's failure, and the front hit came first.",
    "settings": [
     "S1"
    ]
