    "claim": "On 096988dd, with the car at its recorded timing at 1.5x and the ego at 1.2x, every repeat failed. The policy slowed and drifted left, against the STRAIGHT/RIGHT command and the recorded path, and clipped actor 41 passing in the left lane. That is also not the retimed car. A single run at 2x car speed with the ego at its recorded speed did not fail, which hints that the ego's speed matters here. It is one run, so this is a hint, not a result.",
